  unitName: King Squirty
  unitId: 20031
  unitNumber: 46
  description: Squirty is said to evolve into King Squirty after climbing the waterfall
    under which it was born. Unlike Squirty, it likes fighting, yet the clear water
    that it enjoys drinking limits this habitat. If one is careful, it is possible
    to avoid an encounter with King Squirty. Considerably more powerful than Squirty,
    the flood of water it spews is mighty enough to drown someone even on land.
  summonDesc: '*Drip* I''ll go with you!<br>Promise I''ll do my best!<br>*Splash*'
  fusionDesc: My body is is so damp! *Drip*<br>I want more water! *Drop*
  evoDesc: Watch me grow! *Splosh*<br>I'll blast 'em with a jet of <br>water! *Splosh*
